      </AsciiMap>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Successful Infiltration">
        <p>Eerily enough, there are no enemies around the palace. Walk left, up the stairs, and into the <Tag type="place">Meeting Room</Tag> to the right. On the right side is a hidden chest which contains <Tag type="gold">2000 G</Tag>. Go back down the stairs and left two rooms to the <Tag type="place">Training Area</Tag> where you will see a save point. In the lower left corner is a hidden chest which contains <Tag type="gold">2000 G</Tag>. Head up to the save point to advance the plot and climb the vines to do so again.</p>
      </Callout>
      <BossCard name="Blue Granorg Archer x3, Granorg Defender x3" weakness="None">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> These guys seem to really screw up the turn order to prevent combos, so make heavy use of the <Tag type="skill">Change</Tag> command. First, have <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag> cast <Tag type="skill">Magic Boost</Tag> on <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag>. She can one-shot the Archers with any spell, but you&#x27;ll need <Tag type="skill">G-Fire</Tag> to one-shot the Defenders, or an Assault plus any spell. Depending on the turn order, defeat any two of them with an Assault and a spell from Raynie. Try to kill the ones that are breaking up your combos, if you can. Otherwise, just keep taking them out two at a time. You won&#x27;t need to heal.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <p>You&#x27;ll need to retreat the way you came, fighting soldiers along the way, until you make it back to the <Tag type="place">Underground Passage</Tag>. This time, you can move around freely here. Follow the hall up to a fork, where you should first go left to the <Tag type="place">Underground Library</Tag> to find a chest which contains a <Tag type="armor">Cocktail Dress</Tag> (DEF+6/MDF+15, sell). Then, take the right path at the fork to escape.</p>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Princess of Light">
        <p>After some dialogue, you will return to <Tag type="place">Granorg</Tag>.</p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 30 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch30"
    number={30}
    title="Granorg (Standard Chapter 3)"
    timeline="Standard"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="35" party="Stocke, Raynie, Marco"
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <ShopMatrix title="Granorg (Standard Chapter 3) Merchant" items={[{"name": "Soothing Balm", "price": 100}, {"name": "First Aid Kit", "price": 400}, {"name": "Herbal Tea", "price": 350}, {"name": "Healing Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Holy Water", "price": 500}, {"name": "Anti-Poison", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Fear", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Paralytic", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Curse", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Sleep", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Stone", "price": 50}, {"name": "Poison Wing", "price": 350}, {"name": "Sleep Wing", "price": 500}]} equipment={[{"name": "Blitz Epee        2000           Bronze Mail", "price": 900}, {"name": "Silver Edge       3000           Silver Mail", "price": 1100}, {"name": "Rune Edge         5000           Silver Cape", "price": 2800}, {"name": "Soul Eater        4800 (buy 1)   Mail Vest", "price": 1200}, {"name": "Iron Spear        1800           Hymnal Cape", "price": 3700}, {"name": "Silver Spear      2000           Chainmail Dress", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Bloody Pike       3700 (buy 1)   Charm", "price": 350}, {"name": "Bronze Spear      1000           Horn Charm", "price": 1000}, {"name": "Red Dagger        2000           Fang Charm", "price": 1000}, {"name": "Knife             1800           Pawn Stud", "price": 750}, {"name": "Custom Shell      1400           Knight Stud", "price": 1500}, {"name": "Seed Ring", "price": 1000}]} itemTitle="Item Shop" equipmentTitle="Equipment Shop" />
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: The Resistance">
        <p>After some more dialogue, talk to <Tag type="char">Will</Tag> at the bar to unlock the [Sand Sword] node. While not a mandatory event for now, you will eventually have to do it. Head east to the <Tag type="place">Downtown</Tag> area. Somewhat hidden by a tree in the center, you will find <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag> in her cloak, and she will prompt you for a decision. Choosing &quot;Don&#x27;t push yourself&quot; will unlock [Princess&#x27; Charge] ending. Otherwise, choosing &quot;Fulfill your duty&quot; will advance [The King&#x27;s Daughter] sidequest.</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>Go east and north one screen. Talk to the woman in pink to receive the [Despairing Young Man] sidequest. Head south and east one screen, and check out the shops with new wares for sale. I would buy a <Tag type="weapon">Soul Eater</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Stocke</Tag> and a <Tag type="weapon">Bloody Pike</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Rosch</Tag> later. The Soul Eater is great for Stocke&#x27;s physical attacks, but you should hold onto his <Tag type="weapon">Sorcery Epee</Tag> for when you want him to be casting magic instead.</p>
      <p>Return to the &quot;To Granorg&quot; node. Talk to <Tag type="char">Anna</Tag> in the upper left corner of the <Tag type="place">Second Ward</Tag> to complete [The King&#x27;s Daughter] sidequest and to receive the <Tag type="acc">Rabbit&#x27;s Foot</Tag> (MP+10/LUC+15). The Luck stat improves your stealing ability, so you may want to hold onto it for later, but it&#x27;s not critical at all.</p>
      <p>Return to the &quot;Castle Sewers&quot; node and head up to the <Tag type="place">Palace-Front Plaza</Tag>. Talk to the man in the cloak to advance the [Despairing Young Man] sidequest. Return to &quot;The Resistance&quot; node and talk to him again to complete the [Despairing Young Man] sidequest and receive the <Tag type="key">Left-Cut Scroll</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag>, which you should teach to him immediately.</p>
      <p>Leave <Tag type="place">Granorg</Tag> and head to the <Tag type="place">Gran Plain</Tag> to reach <Tag type="place">Cornet Village</Tag>.</p>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game:<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Soul Eater</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Heavy Mail</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Fang Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Magic Spear</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Heavy Mail</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Thaumatech Orb</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Horn Charm</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Wisp Blade</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Heavy Mail</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Sorcery Epee</Tag>, <Tag type="weapon">Bloody Pike</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Horn Charm x6</Tag></p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

